    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Biomancer</strong></p><p><strong>“This is what comes after survival.”</strong></p><p><strong>Strategic</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Strategic Turn, negate a major environmental, casualty, or biological crisis affecting your faction</li><li>Alternatively, convert a lethal condition into a survivable but transformed state</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> major mutation event — identity, physiology, or faction perception permanently altered.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"biomT4\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Negate Crisis</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Negate a major environmental/casualty/biological crisis affecting your faction, OR convert a lethal condition into a survivable but transformed state.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
